From c20a1b5213c3c9ca51f63a381154b0e7f8949bed Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ClayWarren <warren.clay@icloud.com>
Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 16:16:38 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] cmd/dist, internal/testenv: detect MSVC CGo linker capability

Retain Windows ARM64 internal-link support for other compilers and pure Go. Query the active C compiler including configured flags, and declare only MSVC ARM64 CGo external-only because its COFF COMDAT and unwind records are unsupported. Unknown compiler queries retain the existing tests. Cover quoted commands, target overrides, variant registration, and native forced-internal rejection alongside a runnable pure-Go internal link.
---
